@url = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI

### Listar
GET {{url}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear
POST {{url}}/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "marca": "Mercedes-Benz", "modelo": "Sprinter", "patente": "AB123CD", "anio": 2022, "capacidad_carga": 1500 }

### Actualizar
PUT {{url}}/vehiculos/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "marca": "Mercedes-Benz", "modelo": "Sprinter 515", "patente": "AB123CD", "anio": 2022, "capacidad_carga": 1800 }

### Eliminar
DELETE {{url}}/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sin token (401)
GET {{url}}/vehiculos
